Package: lunaplayer
Version: 1.3.3
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: LunaPlayer Project
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-tk, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, python3-gst-1.0, python3-mutagen, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-plugins-ugly, gstreamer1.0-libav, libcdio-utils, cd-discid, eject
Description: Music player for Linux with a Tkinter tray host
 LunaPlayer plays local MP3, WAV, OGG, M4A and audio-only MP4 files and includes playlist,
 metadata editing, embedded artwork and audio-CD detection and direct playback.
